message: "If you use this vault, please cite it as below."
title: "Clearing and Settling the Realm — working vault (HistorEE)"
abstract: >-
  A git-native Foam vault of atomic, cross-linked Markdown notes: the
  idea-side companion to the HistorEE project and the book "Clearing and
  Settling the Realm," applying ergodicity economics and entity-shielding
  to Japanese and comparative financial history. Prose is CC BY 4.0; the
  validation and graph-export tooling is MIT.
